# "You may <cost> rather than pay <subject>'s mana cost": an alternative cost its subject's caster
# may pay [CR#118.9]. "You may cast <subject> without paying its mana cost" is a permission whose
# `cast` carries the alternative cost (`docs/decisions/semantics.md` §4.7).
# TODO(spelling): Spell `payingInstead(<cost>)` here as "pay <cost>".
primitive altCost(cost: AltCost, subject: NounPhrase): StaticSpec = AltCost
